      "name": "[Claret] Scarlet Fever Night",
      "desc": "When Claret's ATK exceeds 1,500, every point of ATK above the threshold increases her DEF by 1.3 points. This effect from different armaments cannot stack. While in the <color=#FFFFFF>Crimson Inscription</color> state, when an attack hits an enemy, the enemy's <color=#2BAD00>DEF is reduced by 16%</color> for 15s, stacking up to 3 times. Repeated triggers reset the duration. Can only be triggered once every 2s.",
